---
description: Structured intake interview to gather requirements before work starts
argument-hint: "[what we're building]"
---
Run an **intake interview** to gather everything needed for: $ARGUMENTS

Ask well-designed questions **one at a time**:
- Offer 2–4 concrete default options to choose from, plus "or type your own".
- Put your recommended option first and give a one-line reason.
- Ask only what resolves real ambiguity; infer the rest and say what you inferred.
- Cover scope, constraints, success criteria, edge cases, and out-of-scope items.

When the interview is done, summarize the gathered requirements as a checklist and ask
the user to confirm. Then hand off to `/refine` (to iterate on a proposal) or begin work.
